<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Talachyn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Talachyn (Belarusian: Талачы́н, Łacinka: Tałačyn, pronounced [taɫaˈtʂɨn]) or Tolochin (Russian: Толо́чин; Polish: Tołoczyn, Yiddish: Tolotshin טאָלאָטשין, Lithuanian: Talačynas) is a city in the Vitebsk Region of Belarus, an administrative center of the Talachyn District. The city has a record low temperature of -42.2C."@en .
