<http://dbpedia.org/resource/F._R._Kempson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Frederick Roberston Kempson (1838 – 1923) was an English architect. Known as F. R. Kempson, he was born at Stoke Lacy in Herefordshire to William Brooke Kempson (1796 - 1859), the rector of Stoke Lacy, and his wife Elizabeth (née Roberston). Kempson married Julia Madeleine Jay in 1866; the marriage produced six children. His granddaughter Rachel (1910–2003), was married to the actor Sir Michael Redgrave."@en .
