<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Plano,_Texas> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Plano** ( [*PLAY-noh*](:Help%3APronunciation_respelling_key%29) is a city in [Collin County](:Collin_County%2C_Texas) and [Denton County, Texas](:Denton_County%2C_Texas), United States. It had a population of 285,494 at the [2020 census](:2020_United_States_census). It is a [principal city](:Principal_city) of the [Dallas–Fort Worth metroplex](:Dallas%E2%80%93Fort_Worth_metroplex)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
