<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Higashi-Fuji_Technical_Center> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Higashi-Fuji Technical Center** (東富士研究所, *Higashi-Fuji Kenkyūjo*) is a [Toyota](:Toyota) [research and development](:Research_and_development) facility in [Susono](:Susono), [Shizuoka](:Shizuoka_Prefecture), [Japan](:Japan). The facility was established in November 1966.Notably, the center contains an advanced [driving simulation](:Driving_simulation) housed inside a 7 meters (23 feet) diameter dome with an actual car inside. The simulator is used to analyse driver behaviors in order to improve safety. Higashi-Fuji also includes a [crash test](:Crash_test) building."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
