<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Arad_McCutchan_Stadium> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Arad McCutchan Stadium, located in Evansville, Indiana, is the home of the University of Evansville soccer teams. It was originally built for the football team, but the university discontinued football in 1997. It is named after Arad McCutchan, who was the basketball coach at the university for 31 years."@en .
