<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ponce,_Puerto_Rico> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ponce (US: /ˈpɔːnseɪ, ˈpoʊn-/, UK: /ˈpɒnseɪ/, Spanish: [ˈponθe], locally [ˈponse]) is both a city and a municipality on the southern coast of Puerto Rico. The city is the seat of the municipal government."@en .
