<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hayley_Stadium> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hayley Stadium was a purpose-built motorcycle speedway located at Queensway Meadows on the eastern side of Newport, Wales. The stadium was 311 yards (284 m) long, and home to the Newport Wasps speedway team. In March 2010 the Wasps engaged a minister to lift a gypsy curse on the stadium. In 2012, the Wasps folded, and within a week of closure, the offices in the main stand sustained fire damage; Hayley Stadium was subsequently demolished."@en .
