<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Alberta_Golden_Bears_and_Pandas> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Alberta Golden Bears and Pandas** are the sports teams that represent the [University of Alberta](:University_of_Alberta) in [Edmonton](:Edmonton), [Alberta](:Alberta), Canada. Alberta athletics teams have won a total of 93 national championships, including 79 [U Sports](:U_Sports) sanctioned sports, making it one of the most successful programs in the country."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
