<http://dbpedia.org/resource/SO_Emyrne> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Stade Olympique de l'Emyrne is the football section of a Malagasy sports club based in Antananarivo, Madagascar. They won the THB Champions League in 2001 and were runners-up in the Coupe de Madagascar in 2003. SOE's 2002 results were forfeited after the team conceded 149 own goals in a match against AS Adema in protest of a refereeing decision. It was the biggest win in a national top division match."@en .
