<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Newport_Wasps> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Newport Wasps** were a British [motorcycle speedway](:Motorcycle_speedway) team based in [Newport](:Newport%2C_Wales), [South Wales](:South_Wales) from 1964 to 2012. They were the 1999 [Conference League](:Conference_League_%28speedway%29) champions. The Wasp logo incorporates the traditional black and amber colours of the City of Newport."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
