<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Asturias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asturias (/æˈstʊəriəs, ə-/, Spanish: [asˈtuɾjas]; Asturian: Asturies [asˈtuɾjes; -ɾjɪs]), officially the Principality of Asturias (Spanish: Principado de Asturias; Asturian: Principáu d'Asturies; Galician-Asturian: Principao d'Asturias), is an autonomous community in northwest Spain. Asturias is also home of the Princess of Asturias Awards."@en .
