<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ōtsu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ōtsu** (大津市, *Ōtsu-shi*) is the capital [city](:Cities_of_Japan) of [Shiga Prefecture](:Shiga_Prefecture), [Japan](:Japan). As of 1 October 2021[[update]](//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C5%8Ctsu&action=edit), the city had an estimated [population](:Population) of 343,991 in 153,458 households and a [population density](:Population_density) of 740 persons per km2. The total area of the city is 464.51 square kilometres (179.35 sq mi)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
