<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Andy_Shallal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Anas** \"**Andy**\" **Shallal** (Template:Lang-ar (born March 21, 1955) is an [Iraqi-American](:Iraqi-American) artist, activist, philanthropist and entrepreneur. He is best known as the founder/[CEO](:Chief_executive_officer) of the [Washington, D.C.](:Washington%2C_D%2EC%2E) area restaurant, bookstore and performance venue [Busboys and Poets](:Busboys_and_Poets). He is also known for his opposition to the [2003 invasion of Iraq](:2003_invasion_of_Iraq). He was a candidate for the [2014 Washington, D.C. mayoral election](:2014_Washington%2C_D%2EC%2E_mayoral_election)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
