<http://dbpedia.org/resource/St._Mary_Help_of_Christians_Church_(Aiken,_South_Carolina)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "St. Mary Help of Christians Church is a Catholic parish of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Charleston. The main parish church is at 138 Fairfield St. SE in Aiken, South Carolina. The campus also includes the historic 1905 church (\"Old Saint Mary's\") at the corner of Park Avenue and York Street, and Ste. Claire Chapel (1880), which sits to the left of the historic church. These two church buildings are listed on the National Register of Historic Places"@en .
